  _englishText: These are your abilities. The first ability drops an atomic bomb
    on a zombie. The second ability restores all your fighters. The third ability
    activates the flamethrower.
  _turkishText: "Bunlar sizin yetenekleriniz. \u0130lk yetenek zombilere atom bombas\u0131
    at\u0131yor. \u0130kinci yetenek, t\xFCm sava\u015F\xE7\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131
    geri y\xFCkler. \xDC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC yetenek alev makinesini etkinle\u015Ftirir."
  _tmpText: {fileID: 1302544740}
