    \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0445 \u0441\u043F\u043E\u0441\u043E\u0431\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0435\u0439."
  _englishText: This is the scale of your points. For every zombie you kill, you
    get one point. Points can be spent on improving your abilities.
  _turkishText: "Bu, puanlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n \xF6l\xE7e\u011Fidir. \xD6ld\xFCr\xFClen
    her zombi i\xE7in bir puan kazan\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z. Yeteneklerinizi geli\u015Ftirmek
    i\xE7in puanlar harcanabilir."
  _tmpText: {fileID: 1499827756}
