--- !u!114 &2123791744
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2123791742}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 453a26398ecb6734db99a8b20546a573, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _label: <size=18><b><color=#FF7F50><i>UiLocalizationText</i></color></b></size>
  _localizationId: WavePopUpTutorial
  _disableTexts: 0
  _russianText: "\u041F\u043E\u0441\u043B\u0435 \u0442\u043E\u0433\u043E, \u043A\u0430\u043A
    \u0432\u044B \u0443\u0431\u044A\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0445 \u0432\u0440\u0430\u0433\u043E\u0432
    \u0432 \u0432\u043E\u043B\u043D\u0435, \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430\u0437\u0430\u043D\u043E
    \u0432\u0441\u043F\u043B\u044B\u0432\u0430\u044E\u0449\u0435\u0435 \u043E\u043A\u043D\u043E
    \u043E \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0438 \u0432\u043E\u043B\u043D\u044B."
  _englishText: After you kill all the enemies in the wave, a pop-up window will
    be shown about the completion of the wave.
  _turkishText: "Dalgadaki t\xFCm d\xFC\u015Fmanlar\u0131 \xF6ld\xFCrd\xFCkten sonra,
    dalgan\u0131n sona erdi\u011Fini g\xF6steren bir a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r pencere
    g\xF6sterilecektir."
  _tmpText: {fileID: 2123791745}
